      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "嗯......搜索完毕。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "“操纵水分子的能力”——能量转换型还是物质重构型源石技艺？不管是什么原理，看着都挺强的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "“水分身”——肉眼完全无法看出破绽？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "这就更有意思了。从事实验研究的人，就和我们机械师一样，观察能力通常都很敏锐。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
          "text": "连赫默和梅尔都上当了的话，这可不是一般的法术幻象。"
